Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: serialize regulatory lifetime and synchronous publication

Supersede the final asynchronous 922 behavior, keeping init once per wiphy.
The group owner must close every member, then drain without ag/core/RTNL/
wiphy/hw_mutex held, before unregister or WMI teardown.
READY opens reception before core_start. Recovery retains is_reset until
all members are ready, then clears it under base_lock and repeats open to
publish latest rules.
These call sites and the unregister cancel migration belong to series 924.

USER_ONLY is an attempt cache. Absorbing DOUBT causes repeated same-country
WMI requests until wiphy destruction; it is not a firmware ACK.

